WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.080
Someone once said:

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:56.220
There are round, round okonomiyaki 
fruits on which pours thick,

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:02.000
rich flavored sweet and spicy sauce, 
over which are sprinkled bonito flakes

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.170
fluttering down from the heavens...

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:13.610
A tree that's quite the 
tentacle... I mean, spectacle!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:17.380
The Takoyatree!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:28.220
There is an archipelago consisting 
of countless omelet islands

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:31.790
made up of layers of sweet whipped cream

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:37.200
or fresh fruits sandwiched 
between fluffy sponge cake....

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:40.830
The Omeletipelago!

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:45.170
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:49.740
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:56.490
Toriko and Komatsu have traveled 
to the frozen continent of Ice Hell

00:02:56.490 --> 00:03:00.590
in order to capture the Century Soup 
which only appears once every 100 years.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.920
His group worked together 
with Match and Takimaru.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:11.230
At the same time, a Vice-Chef of the Gourmet 
Corp, Tommyrod, and his group got in Toriko's way.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:17.140
On the other hand,Tina and Zonge 
hurried along a different route.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:24.180
Teppei, who reached the lowest cave, 
stood eyes wide open, shocked silent...

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.710
Meanwhile, under Chief Mansom's orders, 
Coco hurried to a certain place.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.850
Adult penguins searching for their child 
stood up in front of Toriko and the others.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.750
The glacier crumbled!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:42.160
The Gourmet Show Window, said to show the 
location of the legendary soup, finally appeared!

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:46.800
Toriko leaves Komatsu to capture the soup.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:52.040
And now, the curtain rises on the 
showdown with the Gourmet Corp.!

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:59.310
Gratitude and Pride! Takimaru's 
Full-Out Corkscrew Shot!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.090
Noisy things.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.260
Komatsu, I'm counting on you!

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.870
This is the first time Toriko-san's 
ever asked a favor so earnestly!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.410
I'm counting on you!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.640
This is the first time he's relying on me!

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.610
I've gotta get my hands on the Century Soup!

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.180
Over there?

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.600
Hold on a sec!

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:01.840
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm so...

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:04.810
...rry?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.680
Um...

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:20.420
Gumla Mosquito (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 30

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:30.700
Y-You squashed it! Like, normally!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.970
I don't know how to Knock 
these Insect Beasts...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.540
Shh. Quiet.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.550
You shouldn't speak. Or you'll 
never leave this continent.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.930
The ice isn't melting around here...

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.400
It's strangely quiet, too...

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.370
Is this really the right way?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.140
Don't tell me we're actually 
heading farther and farther

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.910
away from Toriko's group and the soup!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.950
Honestly... This is the 
problem with you newbs!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.420
Don't you know that lately 
it's more in to go with

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:30.720
the route that has the most moving storyline 
instead of the one with the most difficulty?

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.490
We'll reach that ending where we 
capture that soup soon, right?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.590
What are those people talking about?

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.960
I don't understand even 1 milligram!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:44.000
Even before we came here, they've always 
twisted everything into a role-playing game.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.970
This isn't some game! We 
don't get any do-overs!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:55.780
I'm gonna get that shot of the soup 
when it's captured! Definitely!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.250
Man, it's noisy!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.790
Be a good boy and die!

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.890
Penguins!

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.740
Sword Split, Helmet Slice.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.170
Corkscrew Press!

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:09.080
Tommyrod, you bastard!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.350
Was there any point to 
killing those penguins?!

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:13.220
Huh?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.860
Answer the question!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.190
You hungry or something?

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.030
Me? Eat this crap? I don't think so.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.160
I just killed 'em because they were noisy.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.900
You don't just wipe out precious life...

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.810
You even deny them dignity in death.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.610
How horrible...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.380
Rum.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.910
Hand over the Ice Machinegun!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.910
Yes, sir.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.310
I'm gonna be sick...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.780
He's vermin, lower than us.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:46.550
And I'll eradicate this vermin straight away!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:47.390
Barry!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:48.360
Right!

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.260
Oil Shock!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.670
Corkscrew...

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.980
Hold it... You're mine!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.580
...Shot!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:27.930
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.660
Suddenly his voice changed?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.000
There's something off about him...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.970
Nice job shucking my husk...

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.570
Although I don't know who you 
are, or where you are from...

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.040
I am Takimaru, a member 
of the Gourmet Knights!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:44.240
I am the Gourmet Corp.'s 5th Branch 
Culinary Head, Bogie Woods!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:48.010
This'll do fine... I think 
I'll inhabit you next!

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.750
Inhabit me? What's that mean?

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:54.890
A Gourmet Knight, huh?

00:09:54.890 --> 00:10:00.190
I can't even fathom your crazy principles...

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:07.270
But I suppose adding you to my collection 
of dwellings wouldn't be a bad idea!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.130
Head Smash!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.220
Match-san!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.650
Stop runnin' around!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.360
The pain'll be over in an 
instant, so stand still!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.490
Damn you...

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.060
Doesn't seem like guns'll work...

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.100
Fine, then.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.740
I'll take you on.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.370
I'll finish you off with 
my blade, the Dragon King.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.450
What was that attack just now?

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:07.420
You've got good reactions... I 
want to inhabit you even more!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:12.460
You'll make a far better property 
than that lightweight Gourmet SP!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.060
He isn't a piece of property!

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:18.230
I can't say he's alive...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.810
But when I'm inside him, I can manipulate his bones

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:26.730
and nerves just as much as he could when he was.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.940
What?!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:30.380
It's not a disguise or camouflage.

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:34.280
I can even reproduce his quirks and 
voice. In other words, a metamorphosis.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:38.250
So that's why his voice changed 
the moment he shed his husk...

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.820
Resuscitate the organs and 
systems with Knocking...

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:46.160
Start up neurotransmission, 
decipher the hippocampus...

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.480
It's a technique I've learned

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:51.650
to enter the bodies of 
all manner of ingredients for preparation...

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.240
Right now I can call nearly 
100 my "dwellings".

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:59.140
I've got some very skillful properties!

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:02.080
Well, some of them are duds, though.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:03.510
You bastard!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.910
I'm hoping for good things from you...

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.820
...as my brand new home!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.620
Why, you... Don't tell me, that eye...

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.130
Change of plans.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.360
That eye of yours is cursed, isn't it?

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:27.300
Seems this property's got a history...

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.500
Hell if I need a body like that.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:35.910
Irregular Shot!

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.380
Maybe I'll inhabit that mafia guy?

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.220
Naw, I'll take Toriko.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:49.390
I don't wanna get cursed, see.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.330
Takimaru!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.630
At this rate, you might not 
even end up as Bogie's home.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.850
Can they reach the soup before 
the Gourmet Corp. does?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:20.650
At the present stage, I'd give 
them a half and half chance, yes?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.450
Did you just call me handsome?

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:23.550
No, I didn't!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.960
Anyway, what of the Four Heavenly Kings?

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.830
With that info, our judgment 
can be improved some.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.060
You called me handsome again!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.770
It's rainin' handsomes today!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.700
Mind if we take this offline?

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.200
If you're asking about Coco, 
I already sent him there.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.270
Then Coco will be arriving 
at Ice Hell shortly?

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.680
Excellent!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.880
Well, I didn't tell him to go straight there.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:01.490
It sure has been a while, Coco.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.530
It's been too long, Granny Setsu.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.430
You don't have a reservation 
for my special menu...

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:10.830
An emergency?

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.070
I have something I'd like you 
to tell me, Granny Setsu.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:22.110
This left eye of mine became this way 
because of a blessing of someone important to me.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:27.720
My body itself could not exist 
today if it weren't for this eye.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.350
I might be a property 
"with a history" to you,

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:37.060
but this vessel was given to me 
because of the love of that man!

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:39.290
I cannot allow you to live here!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:44.170
I wasn't expecting you to stand up.

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:48.400
I can't dwell in you? I don't get it.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.410
Because you won't pay the rent 
known as "giving thanks"!

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:58.250
Giving thanks?!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.410
Preshot routine...

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.350
Are you an idiot?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.220
Giving thanks for living?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:09.660
You think that's needed to take over a body?!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.590
I can't predict the 
trajectory of his attacks.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.330
I have to strike first!

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.300
Corkscrew Shot!

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.710
Regular Blow!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.020
That's a pretty interesting 
technique of yours.

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:37.850
Separating my joints?

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:43.160
So it was that technique that pulled 
me out of my previous abode, was it?

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:48.190
Impossible! I should have 
just separated your spine!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.530
It's the center of the skeletal system 
and the place which produces blood...

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.430
Furthermore, it's the center 
of the nervous system!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.300
You shouldn't be able 
to move even a finger...

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.140
How can you stand there 
like nothing happened?

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.880
Mysterious? Not really.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:10.080
My skeletal system isn't 
like a normal human's.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:14.690
The shape and number are 
completely different.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.060
A normal human has about 206 bones.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.360
But I have more than 4000 bones!

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:26.460
My skeletal structure is made up of 
20 times the bones of a normal human.

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:31.600
Furthermore, my joints and muscles 
are as limber as a ballerina's!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:33.070
And that's not all...

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:35.110
I can even dislocate them.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:42.310
It's a technique I've learned through 
inhabiting all different kinds of creatures.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.250
It's not just humans...

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:48.250
I can invade creatures of 
all kinds of shapes now.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.650
Understand?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:55.890
I can manipulate a body with a 
great number of different joints!

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:58.800
I can enter pretty much any living creature.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.740
So the reason I couldn't predict 
his attacks was because

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.640
of the number of his bones and the complexity of his joints!

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:09.170
Even so, I'll give you credit 
for dislocating my hip bone.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.880
You would have won if I was a normal human.

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:16.310
But I'm sorry to say that even if my spine is 
separated, I can support my body with other bones.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:20.320
Nerve impulses can even be 
transmitted through other bones!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.090
His bones are turning into 
a scythe and a weight!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:26.120
Let's finish this!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.990
Irregular Iron!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.530
Why, you...

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.270
Noticed? That's right...

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.910
A chain and sickle! He's using 
his own joints as the chain!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.910
Can you predict this movement, huh?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.760
This is bad... I really can't predict 
the movement of his attacks!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.030
Unless I can close in...

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:09.030
Corkscrew Shot!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.930
And what's the point of that?

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:15.840
That ain't gonna work on me!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.170
Shot!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.270
It's no use!

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.110
Shot!

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.240
Shot!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.380
No use!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.550
It doesn't matter how 
many bones you dislocate!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.650
It's no use!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:49.000
Hate to break it to you, but you couldn't 
have picked a worse opponent than me.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.070
And we'd finally found it...

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.870
Huh? Did you say something?

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:57.710
I've taken too much damage...

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:00.380
A lot of my bones are broken...

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:03.820
This is bad... I'm losing consciousness...

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.990
Is this the end?

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.620
Takimaru!

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.660
Toriko!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.860
Is this really the time to 
be worrying about others?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.610
You aren't concentrating enough.

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:31.640
Taki!

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:51.800
How many times have I told you?

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:56.630
When you let out the technique, you 
can't lose the image in your mind.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.170
So you have to increase your 
powers of concentration.

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:04.880
I'll teach you a simple way...

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.390
What's this?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.400
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.670
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:12.040
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:15.510
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:18.880
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.950
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:25.720
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.290
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:32.460
Two-way communication!

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:35.930
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.700
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:43.070
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.940
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:49.610
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:53.180
Fight with bravery!

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:56.920
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:03.490
Gourmet News!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.390
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:08.800
It's finally the climactic battle 
in sub-zero temperatures!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.800
In this frigid cold...

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.370
Huh? Cameraman, over here!

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:17.040
I do apologize for that.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:18.600
Now, let's start over!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.270
This frigid cold is a powerful foe!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:26.210
So I'll present to you a simple recipe 
combining 3 flavors to warm you up!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:28.180
What you'll need are:

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:31.220
Udon noodles, noodle sauce, and plain yogurt!

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:33.720
Mix the three of them together well...

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:39.860
It's udon with the flavor 
of white-sauce gratin!

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:48.030
Being able to savor udon and a dish that warms 
you up in the winter... Two for the price of one!

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:52.440
Yo-gurt... Mix it up nice and good...

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:54.610
...or you'll ge' hurt.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:58.040
Huh? This was supposed to warm you up...

00:22:58.040 --> 00:22:59.840
So why do I feel this heaping 
load of chills down my spine?

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:04.780
Now, on to the next story.

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:09.090
The all-out battle reaches it's climax!

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:12.220
Who will win contest for glory?

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:16.390
Settled! Match and Takimaru's 
Desperate Attack!

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:18.530
Look forward to another 
heaping helping of fun!
